    "verdict": "NO significant shell signature: magic-configuration residuals sit within 2 sigma of the rest. The ~4% is consistent with noise plus whatever the held-fixed B_pp confound contributes, and does NOT by itself argue against a purely geometric factor. It also means the residuals carry no discriminating information between the two surviving hypotheses -- so the tie must be broken elsewhere (bean qou-gcmn: bound the A-dependence of B_pp). A systematic drift with A is also present, which points at an unmodelled monotone factor -- the prime suspect remains the A=3-fixed B_pp unit.",
